# Pack 569 — response headers on Cloudflare Pages.
#
# A TEMPLATE. scripts/build-site.mjs fills the double-brace placeholders per target and
# writes the result to _site/_headers without these comments; this file is never uploaded
# as it stands. (GitHub Pages ignores it too: Jekyll skips files that start with "_".)
#
# Content-Security-Policy, one directive at a time:
#   script-src   the sha256 of the page's one inline <script>, computed by the build, plus
#                (production and staging) the Firebase SDK's exact gstatic path, read from
#                SYNC_SDK_BASE in index.html, and apis.google.com for Google sign-in. No 'unsafe-inline', so inline onclick="…" handlers do not run;
#                the build refuses a page that has one.
#   style-src    'unsafe-inline': the page is one <style> block and hundreds of style="…".
#   img-src      the page's own images, data: and blob: (downloads, QR codes).
#   connect-src  what the page's BACKEND needs. 'firestore' (production today): Firestore,
#                Firebase Auth and open-meteo weather. 'api' (staging, and production once
#                the pack moves): 'self' for this site's /api, Firebase Auth and weather —
#                no Firestore host at all. Preview: open-meteo only, so even a stray config
#                could not reach the live pack.
#                The calendar-from-a-link fetch is deliberately not allowed; the dialog
#                falls back to "paste the calendar text instead". See docs/cloudflare-setup.md.
#   frame-src    production and staging: the Firebase authDomain and apis.google.com (sign-in).
#                Preview: none.
#
# Referrer-Policy is strict-origin-when-cross-origin, not no-referrer: a Google API key can
# be restricted by referrer, and no-referrer would break it.
# Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy keeps the Google sign-in popup able to report back.
# Permissions-Policy turns off what the app never uses (it only writes to the clipboard).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'sha256-{{HASH}}' {{SCRIPT_ORIGINS}}; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src {{CONNECT}}; frame-src {{FRAME}}; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
# Preview and staging builds add X-Robots-Tag: noindex here, so their URLs are never listed in search.
{{PREVIEW_ONLY}}
